{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"acb9bd4fdd02868c2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 ε-optimal 算法的理论收敛速率，特别是 ε → 0 时的最坏情况复杂度。\n\n**背景：** Round 7 ε-Certified 金矿提到 5%→1%→0% 三阶段。但理论上后期收紧的代价多大？是否有 closed-form bound？\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. PTAS / FPTAS 经典理论 (Karp, Vazirani)\n2. ε-optimal MIP 收敛速率\n3. Anytime 算法的 competitive ratio\n4. 跟 LP relaxation 强度的关系\n5. 实证 benchmark：5% → 1% → 0% 各占多少时间\n6. 是否有 closed-form 给\"最后 1%\" 占比\n\n输出末尾：\"对我们 168h budget 分配的具体建议（每 stage 多少时间）\""},"uuid":"1935b5d5-475e-4304-9017-f706ed610027","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:49.755Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
